# The dbt image build uses the repo root as context (it COPYs transform/ and src/).
# Allowlist only what the Dockerfile needs so the context stays small.
# Image contents are declared in three places — this allowlist, the Dockerfile's
# COPYs (src/lambdas/dbt/Dockerfile), and the image_hash fingerprint in
# infra/pipelines/dbt/locals.tf. Keep them in sync.
*
!transform/
!src/shared/
!src/lambdas/dbt/
transform/dbt_packages/
transform/target/
transform/logs/
transform/.user.yml
